#X text 240 83 WebSocket is a protocol that provides full-duplex communication
channels over a single TCP connection \, widely used in web applications
for real-time data exchange;
#X text 240 138 the object connects to a WebSocket server at the specified
URL and exchanges text \, binary or JSON messages;
#X text 240 178 the [write( methods buffer messages \, call [flush(
to send them \, the [send( methods send messages immediately;
#X text 50 281 you can start testing websocket server with command:
